	"smallSizeObservation": {
		"en": "At 128/64 px the deck shape, green routing and layered rim remain readable. At 32/24/16 px the transparent mark resolves to a dark diamond-like block with a green circuit signature; individual vias and the small arc merge into that accent.",
		"zh": "128/64 px 能读出甲板形状、绿色走线和层叠侧缘；32/24/16 px 透明标记凝练为带绿色电路特征的深色菱形方块，独立过孔与小电弧合并为色彩点缀。"
	}
